<mxCell id="9" value="&lt;b&gt;Billing Feedback Correction Loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:10px;&#x27;&gt;Billing Team replies on email thread detailing:&lt;br/&gt;• Weight or rate discrepancy&lt;br/&gt;• Missing fuel / terminal surcharges&lt;br/&gt;• Ambiguous commercial terms&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#dc2626;fontColor=#991b1b;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=center;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
